{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic puzzle where attention, logic, and speed work as a team. Each level is a new challenge: find your way out of tangled mazes, collect the necessary elements, search for hidden details, move objects, and match the right colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built on constant variety: sometimes a quick reaction test, sometimes a thoughtful task where strategy matters. No repetitions here\u2014each level reveals an unusual format and requires finding a solution where it seems impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Levels for attentiveness, reaction, and logic <br>\ud83e\udde9 Combination of genres: from puzzles to dynamic mini-games <br>\ud83c\udf1f Bright and diverse visual design <br>\u23f3 Short rounds that easily draw you in <br>\ud83d\udd11 Simple mechanics, but engaging from the first minutes</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"LvL 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3976510/fe02961ac68481bbb65fa749d9e178ae94228d3f.jpg"},{"name":"LvL 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3976510/3102384508017c3b5c6def4033d6b3a5c8fdb8f7.jpg"},{"name":"LvL 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3976510/134416d67a48b856bb69d01cc072220dce55c914.jpg"},{"name":"LvL 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3976510/9687324b0e0472954b4ac1412013cf5780857249.jpg"},{"name":"LvL 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3976510/26c0348b277f946a79fae9571d1c8a18d66780be.jpg"},{"name":"LvL 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3976510/b9935c90c50accb5db5c18abc943578dfd80070c.jpg"},{"name":"LvL4 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3976510/2df3323c52a89c8fdf044cf955f0afc75afd1825